== Notes ==
* {{i|Terra}} can destroy the The Shell's armor, along with any items that create rock waves like {{i|Mega Bean}} and {{i|Wait What?}}.
* {{i|Sulfuric Acid}} tears cannot destroy their armor.

== Trivia ==
* They appear to be a bony variation of The Hollow.
* They appear to be the posthumous version of the {{e|Tuff Twins}}. This makes them one of four boss pairs to have their regular and posthumous version in the same chapter, the others being {{e|Gemini}} having {{e|Blighted Ovum}} in [[Chapter 1]], {{e|Chub}} having {{e|Carrion Queen}} in Chapter 2 and {{e|Polycephalus}} having {{e|The Stain}} in [[Chapters|Chapter 2]].

